<h2 id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24 font-headline-md text-primary mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<div class="not-prose space-y-4 mb-12">
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">Which facial cosmetic surgery gives the biggest change?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Skeletal procedures (orthognathic surgery, genioplasty, rhinoplasty) change the underlying structure and give the most lasting, balanced change. Soft-tissue procedures add or remove volume but cannot fix a poorly-positioned skeleton.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">What is the most popular facial cosmetic surgery?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Globally, rhinoplasty and blepharoplasty are the most common. In India, orthognathic surgery is increasingly common as awareness grows.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">Is facial cosmetic surgery safe?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">In experienced hands, yes. See <a href="side-effects-of-maxillofacial-surgery-risks-complications-and-prevention.php" class="font-semibold text-secondary">side effects, risks, and complications</a>.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">At what age can I have facial cosmetic surgery?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">After facial growth is complete (16–18 for females, 18–21 for males). Non-surgical options are available earlier.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">Will I look unnatural after surgery?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">When planned and executed by an experienced surgeon, no. The goal is balance and harmony — not "done."</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">How long do results last?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Skeletal procedures last a lifetime. Soft-tissue surgery lasts 8–15 years. Non-surgical treatments last months to a few years.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">Can I combine procedures?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Yes — many patients combine rhinoplasty with genioplasty, or jaw surgery with fat grafting. Combining is safe when planned carefully.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">How do I find a good surgeon in India?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">See <a href="how-to-choose-the-best-maxillofacial-surgeon-in-hyderabad.php" class="font-semibold text-secondary">how to choose the best maxillofacial surgeon in Hyderabad</a>.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">How much does facial cosmetic surgery cost in India?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Costs vary widely with the procedure and the city. Non-surgical treatments like fillers and Botox typically range from a few thousand to tens of thousands of rupees per session. Surgical procedures such as <a href="what-is-orthognathic-surgery.php" class="font-semibold text-secondary">orthognathic surgery</a>, rhinoplasty, or a facelift are higher and depend on hospital, anaesthesia, and complexity. Always ask for an itemised quote and what is included.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">How do I know if I need surgery or non-surgical treatment?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">A good rule: if the issue is bone position, you need skeletal surgery. If the issue is skin, fat, or muscle, non-surgical or soft-tissue surgery often works. The best way to know is a face-to-face consultation with imaging — a <a href="how-to-choose-the-best-maxillofacial-surgeon-in-hyderabad.php" class="font-semibold text-secondary">qualified maxillofacial surgeon</a> will tell you honestly which path serves you.</p></details>
<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">What questions should I ask during my consultation?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Ask how many times the surgeon has performed your specific procedure, what the realistic result will look like, the risks and complications, the recovery time, and what happens if you are unhappy with the result. Also ask about the <a href="recovery-time-after-jaw-surgery-complete-healing-timeline-and-care-tips.php" class="font-semibold text-secondary">full recovery timeline</a> so you can plan time off work.</p></details>
</div></div>
